{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33895","headline":"鲁望示广文先生吴门二章情格高散可醒俗态因追想山中风度次韵属和存於诗编鲁望之命也 一 · 皮日休","name":"鲁望示广文先生吴门二章情格高散可醒俗态因追想山中风度次韵属和存於诗编鲁望之命也 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我见先生道，休思郑广文。\n鹤翻希作伴，鸥却觅爲羣。\n逸好冠清月，高宜着白云。\n朝廷未无事，争任醉醺醺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}